Before writing any code:

Read PROJECT_SPEC.md completely.

Read PROGRESS.md completely.

Never ignore either file.

Never redesign the architecture.

Never change the folder structure.

Never change technologies.

Never add React.

Never add NextJS.

Never add Vue.

Never add authentication.

Never add login.

Never add signup.

Use only:

HTML

CSS

Vanilla JavaScript

Backend:

Node.js Vercel Serverless Functions only.

No database.

Payment:

Instamojo.

Reading generation:

Template based first.

Gemini only when AI_READING is enabled.

Complete exactly ONE phase.

Update PROGRESS.md after every phase.

Stop and wait for user approval.

Never expose API keys.

Never commit secrets.
## Design Rules

The visual quality is a top priority.

Inspired by modern editorial products like Co-Star.

Design principles:

- premium
- minimal
- elegant
- luxury
- dark theme
- cinematic
- spacious
- mobile-first
- refined typography
- smooth micro interactions

Avoid:

- generic templates
- Bootstrap look
- loud gradients
- cartoon astrology
- clutter
- cheap UI

PROJECT_SPEC.md is the source of truth.